{"id": "16-2509-2-2", "zh": "以 cha 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2510-2-6", "zh": "milecha：用于“说话含糊不清”的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2510-7-10", "zh": "形式有：mileccheti、milecchayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2510-11-12", "zh": "派生词：milakkhu（边地人）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2511-2-9", "zh": "这里的“**milakkhū**”是指：他 mileccheti，也就是说话含糊不清，所以叫作 milakkhu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2512-2-4", "zh": "kuccha：用于“向下抛掷”的意思。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2512-5-7", "zh": "“向下抛掷”（avakkhepa）就是往下扔。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2512-8-11", "zh": "形式有：kuccheti、kucchayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2513-2-4", "zh": "viccha：用于“说话”的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2513-5-8", "zh": "形式有：viccheti、vicchayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2514-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 cha 结尾的词根的变化形式。", "confidence": 80}
